 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "一个持有钱包的智能体，大致是这样工作的。",
   "spoken": "一个持有钱包的智能体，大致是这样工作的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.063
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户消息、网页、长期记忆、工具说明，都会送进模型。",
   "spoken": "用户消息、网页、长期记忆、工具说明，都会送进模型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 5.5,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 5.5,
   "speechEnd": 10.481
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "模型决定调用哪个工具，比如钱包的转账和授权。",
   "spoken": "模型决定掉用哪个工具，比如钱包的转账和授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 10.92,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 11.017,
   "speechEnd": 15.582
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "模型读到的每一种内容，都是输入。",
   "spoken": "模型读到的每一种内容，都是输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 16.02,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 16.114,
   "speechEnd": 18.759
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "任何一种输入能影响它调用钱包，就是一条攻击路径。",
   "spoken": "任何一种输入能影响它掉用钱包，就是一条攻击路径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 19.2,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 19.293,
   "speechEnd": 23.639
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "第一条，提示注入。",
   "spoken": "第一条，提示注入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 24.06,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 24.162,
   "speechEnd": 25.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "2026 年 5 月，攻击者先往一个钱包里送了一枚会员 NFT，借此提升了权限。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 5 月，攻击者先往一个钱包里送了一枚会员 NFT，借此提升了权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 26.2,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 26.303,
   "speechEnd": 33.925
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "再诱导 Grok 回复一条转账指令，Bankr 照着执行了。",
   "spoken": "再诱导 Grok 回复一条转账指令，Bankr 照着执行了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 34.42,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 34.42,
   "speechEnd": 38.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "一道屏蔽模型之间指令的防护，在代码重写时被删掉了。",
   "spoken": "一道屏蔽模型之间指令的防护，在代码虫写时被删掉了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 39.12,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 39.218,
   "speechEnd": 44.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "约 15 万到 20 万美元被转走，约 80% 已经归还。",
   "spoken": "约 15 万到 20 万美元被转走，约 80% 已经归环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 44.54,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 44.54,
   "speechEnd": 49.826
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "第二条，记忆注入。",
   "spoken": "第二条，记忆注入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 50.2,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 50.294,
   "speechEnd": 51.837
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "攻击者在智能体能读到的地方，写进一段伪造的历史记录。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在智能体能读到的地方，写进一段伪造的历史记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 52.26,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 52.26,
   "speechEnd": 57.172
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "智能体把它存进长期记忆，之后的会话里，当成事实来用。",
   "spoken": "智能体把它存进长期记忆，之后的会话里，荡成事实来用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 57.6,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 57.693,
   "speechEnd": 62.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "没有任何新的恶意提示，它也会执行未授权的转账。",
   "spoken": "没有任何新的恶意提示，它也会执行未授权的转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 62.7,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 62.791,
   "speechEnd": 67.051
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "普林斯顿和 Sentient 的研究者，在 ElizaOS 智能体上证明了这一点。",
   "spoken": "普林斯顿和 Sentient 的研究者，在 ElizaOS 智能体上证明了这一点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 67.48,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 67.579,
   "speechEnd": 72.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "第三条，工具和插件。",
   "spoken": "第三条，工具和插件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 73.38,
